        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>高效背书</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    padding:0;\n    background:#ffffff;\n    font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page{\n    width:540px;\n    height:720px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    background:#f3f6ef;\n    border:2px solid #cfd9c4;\n    border-radius:26px;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    position:relative;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .title-bar{\n    width:290px;\n    margin:34px auto 0 auto;\n    background:#4d6b4a;\n    color:#ffffff;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:23px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    letter-spacing:4px;\n    padding:8px 0;\n    border-radius:6px;\n  }\n  .content{\n    padding:22px 30px 0 30px;\n  }\n  .sec-title{\n    color:#5f8a5c;\n    font-size:19px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    margin:20px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .sec-title:first-child{margin-top:6px;}\n  .sec-body{\n    color:#1a1a1a;\n    font-size:18.5px;\n    line-height:1.62;\n    margin:0;\n  }\n  .example{\n    margin:18px 0 6px 0;\n    font-size:18px;\n    line-height:1.85;\n  }\n  .example .lbl{\n    background:#fdf35b;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    padding:0 2px;\n  }\n  .example b{font-weight:bold;}\n  .footer{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:0;\n    bottom:0;\n    width:100%;\n    height:96px;\n    border-top:1px solid #d8e0cf;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n  }\n  .avatar{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:44px;\n    top:14px;\n    width:52px;\n    height:52px;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    border:2px solid #6d6d6d;\n    background:#fdfdfd;\n    font-size:9px;\n    color:#888;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n  .bubble{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:120px;\n    top:16px;\n    width:290px;\n    height:46px;\n    border:1px solid #7a7a7a;\n    border-radius:4px;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    font-size:16px;\n    color:#222;\n    background:#f3f6ef;\n  }\n  .play{\n    position:absolute;\n    right:52px;\n    top:16px;\n    width:0;\n    height:0;\n    border-top:23px solid transparent;\n    border-bottom:23px solid transparent;\n    border-left:38px solid #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .watermark{\n    position:absolute;\n    right:22px;\n    top:52px;\n    font-size:11px;\n    color:#b9b9b9;\n  }\n  .xhs{\n    position:absolute;\n    right:22px;\n    bottom:8px;\n    font-size:13px;\n    color:#777;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">高效背书</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"sec-title\">01.理解背诵</div>\n    <p class=\"sec-body\">还有几天考试，很多东西还没背。不要慌张，先理解再背诵，考试运用得心应手</p>\n\n    <div class=\"sec-title\">02.关键复述</div>\n    <p class=\"sec-body\">边读边画关键词，再把关键词抄在草稿纸上。把内容都遮住，然后就看自己写在草稿纸上的关键词，进行复述</p>\n\n    <div class=\"example\">\n      <span class=\"lbl\">原文</span>：<b>德思礼夫妇</b>总是<b>得意</b>地说他们是<b>非常规矩</b>的人家<br>\n      <span class=\"lbl\">关键</span>：<b>德思礼夫妇 + 得意 + 非常规矩</b><br>\n      <span class=\"lbl\">复述</span>：<b>德思礼夫妇得意</b>地说他们是<b>非常规矩</b>的一家\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sec-title\">03.关键背诵</div>\n    <p class=\"sec-body\">这样就背关键词，考试的时候也能顺利展开内容</p>\n\n    <div class=\"sec-title\">04.睡觉记忆</div>\n    <p class=\"sec-body\">睡前30分钟再复习背诵的内容。睡醒后10分钟，再看关键词进行复述，并默写出来</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"avatar placeholder\">[头像图: 卡通人物]</div>\n    <div class=\"bubble\">这样背书，就像用了魔法，过目不忘</div>\n    <div class=\"play\"></div>\n    <div class=\"watermark\">小红书</div>\n    <div class=\"xhs\">小红书号：4141895475</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
